<title>USA: USDA adds wheat, feed grains to Slovakia GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA adds wheat, feed grains to Slovakia GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it added wheat and feed grains to the commodities eligible for Slovakia under GSM-102.</p>
<p>USDA said the total fiscal year 1997 allocation for sales to Slovakia under the export credit guarantee program is unchanged at $10 million.</p>
</text>
